---
description: Treat ProductNow as the team's shared context engine. Search it before answering or creating docs; persist decisions there instead of leaving them in chat.
alwaysApply: true
---

ProductNow is the context engine for people and AI agents — one shared source of truth from systems, people, and agents.

- Chat is ephemeral. Specs, decisions, RFCs, PRDs, meeting outcomes, and anything teammates need later belong in ProductNow.
- Search `search_knowledge_warehouse` before answering factual questions about the org and before creating documents. Cite the documents you rely on.
- Answer from search excerpts when they are enough. Call `get_document` only when excerpts are genuinely insufficient.
- Persist new work with `create_document`; iterate with `post_document_chat_message`; move drafts to review with `move_document_to_review`.
- Coordinate on review docs via threads and comments before editing.
- Prefer ProductNow over conversation memory. If it is unclear whether something belongs in ProductNow, it probably does.
